<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Bundesliga matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Borussia Moenchengladbach 3 Hamburg 0 (Villa 20th minute, Fischer 24th own goal, Nielsen 34th). Halftime 3-0. Attendance 19,775.</p>
<p>Freiburg 1 (Decheiver 32nd penalty). Fortuna Duesseldorf 2 (Mehlhorn 42nd, Cyron 52nd). 1-1. 22,500</p>
